      "question": "Why is my Bitaxe Gamma making less hashrate than the listing says?",
      "ok": true,
      "answer": "Most likely the listing assumes a higher clock. At stock settings (525 MHz) a Gamma should average about 1.07 TH/s, while many listings quote 1.2 TH/s or more. Check the 10-minute average rather than the live number, and make sure the power supply is correct and the fan and heatsink are clean. If it was used, a previous owner may have overclocked it, so reset it to stock.",
